{"code":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify","tips":[{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74104","section":"Red commercial plates","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=IRh57DUfu4qgIXHSUBDegw&viewpoint=23.5859158%2C58.3790099&heading=348.43&pitch=-13.180000000000007","text":"Type: Commercial Shape: Long Background: Red Text: White Additional details: In Street view blur the left side is heavily whitened, while the right side stays clean and red.","countryCodes":["OM"],"sourceTagId":"74104","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-dbe71f75ea510cc85f1a.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74115","section":"Yellow plates","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=kTFAQ6PEw8BYovPOWDJOAA&viewpoint=17.0918967%2C54.2089516&heading=218.75&pitch=26.46","text":"Type: Private Shape: Long Background: Yellow Text: Black Additional details: In Street view blur the left side is heavily darkened, while the right side stays clean and yellow.","countryCodes":["OM"],"sourceTagId":"74115","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-632e332977165074ca37.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74100","section":"Licence Plates","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=FA017viTmEyEHLjVN31JnA&viewpoint=24.910409%2C55.0895498&heading=55.92&pitch=-8.469999999999999","text":"UAE license plates vary by emirate in their numbering, lettering, and sometimes colour, featuring distinct designs for each of the seven emirates. Private vehicle plates are typically white","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74100","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-7eff96d374671b0efc38.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74103","section":"Green Plates","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=9vgMmIlJSxWADqzeGJULDA&viewpoint=24.9348422%2C55.0408331&heading=212.25&pitch=-4.109999999999999","text":"Type: Commercial Shape: Long Background: Green Text: White Additional details: A white blur in the center-bottom of the license plate","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74103","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-7b5a8869e1f2dbadbeab.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74111","section":"Garbage bins","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=v-EYz8OB9laBeCxA3KMqow&viewpoint=17.1002588%2C54.2040368&heading=123.64&pitch=-20.730000000000004","text":"Material: Plastic or metal Color: Black or grey Text: 3-leaf logo and the word ‘be’ah’ (only 1 e)","countryCodes":["OM"],"sourceTagId":"74111","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-43b1a129c4910f2b2d32.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74113","section":"Plastic Bins","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=6ooHyPTRcNdWKEgdM6y7HA&viewpoint=25.14407551305691%2C56.34435821723442&heading=238.95358513414314&pitch=30.63322840016292","text":"Household and street bins are usually large plastic wheelie bins in light green, yellow or black, often with Arabic and English labels Usually you can find words like \"General Waste\" or bee'ah (with double e vs Oman with single e!)","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74113","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-a8af4f6606140eb39ae5.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74114","section":"Metall Bins","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=cGUVsNb1nvKV_SNqflSZ9Q&viewpoint=25.1691702%2C55.258894&heading=318.0&pitch=-21.17","text":"Big and wide metal dumpsters are also common near construction sites or apartment blocks. Sometimes they have chevrons with white background and red diagonal lines","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74114","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-6d2b9359c9f4158fed66.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74101","section":"Chevron","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=i0MZp9-qTgVpgdZdPhPjRQ&viewpoint=24.8518929%2C55.0801347&heading=354.25&pitch=-5.459999999999994","text":"White Background + red arrows","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74101","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-37d4149f0cd1364b95c3.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74106","section":"Yellow and black chevron","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=1tlCS0FOQqTpfzRGmEU1QA&viewpoint=20.8792421%2C58.192796&heading=99.25&pitch=-5.760000000000005","text":"Background: Yellow Arrows: Thin black Additional details: Lots of arrows","countryCodes":["OM"],"sourceTagId":"74106","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-c418a1b9f660c0a97f3e.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74102","section":"Falcon emblem","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=FRZCQoxUwv6BaSOIf5ABqQ&viewpoint=24.9866997%2C55.1497742&heading=227.51&pitch=8.39","text":"The falcon emblem, officially the Hawk of Quraish, appears on UAE highway signs because it represents the national symbol. Using this emblem on highways flags these routes as inter-emirate or national, helping drivers quickly identify major strategic roads.","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74102","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-74ccede11d8d6cde27e1.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74110","section":"Yellow outer lines yellow centre line","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=KgM-jQtmSnwHUOlQNsO2Kw&viewpoint=25.121171%2C55.3894861&heading=321.35&pitch=-14.090000000000003","text":"Outer lines: Yellow Center lines: Yellow Rare (mostly white center) but possible. In Oman you can't find yellow center lines","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74110","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-47b4bc57e604f770f92f.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74109","section":"Doubled or tripled poles","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=X-evKrPg_HQSRFXgDNbW7A&viewpoint=22.795361%2C57.705619&heading=155.08&pitch=5.939999999999998","text":"Utility poles connected with an X (double or triple) can be found in Oman but not in the UAE","countryCodes":["OM"],"sourceTagId":"74109","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-06d528827b8220a96570.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74116","section":"Pole Attachments","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=MPdAr_BCiF9FuRMP-xZgNw&viewpoint=24.9355353%2C55.045695&heading=298.69&pitch=-4.1200000000000045","text":"Many concrete utility poles carry small white ID plates with black numbers. These labels show the pole’s unique code or location reference and are usually fixed at eye level.","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74116","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-4f632294b9348215ea9d.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74112","section":"Bar above pole","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=f5P7ds0FH5JRar0RAIGwlw&viewpoint=16.8537185%2C53.401183&heading=223.64&pitch=4.019999999999996","text":"Shape: Cylinder Material: Wood Top: Attached horizontal metallic bar with 3 insulators Unique: A horizontal bar attached to the pole above the wooden post","countryCodes":["OM"],"sourceTagId":"74112","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-8583e3f3f7744cf3702a.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74117","section":"Falcon emblem on utility poles","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=thG2uACCbwnziXZJuUNjfg&viewpoint=25.155671%2C56.18134&heading=292.05&pitch=-6.359999999999999","text":"A unique falcon emblem can be found on utility poles","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74117","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-5ad81211f8d7f5ad13a7.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74107","section":"Direction Boards","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=lE8_G33O_NS4ocIWHqSwiQ&viewpoint=25.1206786%2C55.2248858&heading=282.64&pitch=4.480000000000004","text":"- Green boards are for local roads within an emirate - blue boards mark national highways that connect different emirates. Green signs often carry the Dubai castle emblem, and blue signs display the falcon symbol","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74107","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-ab819ad59df4840564a0.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74105","section":"Black car with visible brake-light","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=my5bITgK11QwEB1dGerjPA&viewpoint=24.8406287%2C55.0961291&heading=43.68&pitch=-34.44","text":"Some Gen 4 coverage in the UAE comes from a black car with a visible high brake light","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74105","temporallySensitive":true,"image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-f40aef65122a845d65cd.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74108","section":"White/silver car","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=cZxSBU2oS3br70jSa0_YbA&viewpoint=25.810731%2C55.9550067&heading=333.88&pitch=-35.92","text":"Nearly all Generation 3 in the UAE was filmed from a white or silver/grey car (sometimes with visible black roof racks) Sometimes car is not visible vs Oman and Qatar: No Generation 3 at all","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74108","temporallySensitive":true,"image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-8f4f125db791160f14cf.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-oman-vs-uae-how-to-identify-74118","section":"Rifts","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Mz1Hk_0KePGRhyBb_hK9ww&viewpoint=25.287251471885604%2C55.65555168180437&heading=205.9971661088523&pitch=16.757836841004817","text":"You can sometimes find rifts in old-generation Google panoramas","countryCodes":["AE"],"sourceTagId":"74118","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-96fdd466a29d30ee5ca0.avif"}]}